<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-4885] .NET: Meaningless exception on generic type in BinaryConfiguration</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-4885</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;tt&gt;BinaryTypeConfiguration&lt;/tt&gt; does not support open generic types (when parameters are not specified, like &lt;tt&gt;typeof(List&amp;lt;&amp;gt;)&lt;/tt&gt; instead of &lt;tt&gt;typeof(List&amp;lt;int&amp;gt;&lt;/tt&gt;). But the exception is not helpful, and stack trace is very short (because of native transition).&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;We should try to provide meaningful exception message and a proper stack trace.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
